cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "arbitrarydim_sandpiles: stabilization of the Abelian sandpile on a hypercube in any dimension"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/nitromannitol/arbitrarydim_sandpiles"
abstract: >-
  Julia code, for the CPU and for CUDA GPUs, that computes the odometer of the parallel
  toppling of the Abelian sandpile on a hypercube in any dimension, on the fundamental domain
  of the hypercube. It accompanies the paper "Dynamic dimensional reduction in the Abelian
  sandpile".
authors:
  - family-names: Bou-Rabee
    given-names: Ahmed
keywords:
  - Julia
  - Abelian sandpile
  - parallel toppling
  - odometer
  - GPU
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Dynamic dimensional reduction in the Abelian sandpile"
    authors:
      - family-names: Bou-Rabee
        given-names: Ahmed
    journal: "Communications in Mathematical Physics"
    volume: 390
    start: 933
    end: 958
    year: 2022
    doi: "10.1007/s00220-022-04322-z"
    url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2009.05968"
    notes: "The paper that this code accompanies."
